WEBVTT

00:06.010 --> 00:08.250
You there, are you okay?

00:12.270 --> 00:14.360
You're the sorcerer, Zagan's...

00:14.720 --> 00:15.820
It's you...

00:16.200 --> 00:17.490
The Angelic Knight!

00:17.810 --> 00:19.910
Oh, I see.

00:20.810 --> 00:23.460
I'm going to be killed.

00:24.720 --> 00:28.310
Go on. Collect my head or
 whatever you intend to do.

00:28.310 --> 00:30.080
Hang on! You've got the wrong idea!

00:30.080 --> 00:31.760
I'm not going to hurt you!

00:32.090 --> 00:34.860
Angelic Knights kill sorcerers, don't they?

00:34.860 --> 00:36.870
I'm an apprentice to one.

00:36.870 --> 00:38.490
Now, go on.

00:39.680 --> 00:41.570
Hey, what's all the commotion?

00:41.570 --> 00:43.390
Is that Nephy down there?

00:43.760 --> 00:45.560
Is an Angelic Knight hassling her?

00:45.560 --> 00:48.570
Oh, right, because she works for a sorcerer...

00:49.320 --> 00:51.160
What's the matter?

00:51.160 --> 00:55.010
Don't Angelic Knights execute all 
known associates of sorcerers?

00:55.010 --> 00:58.070
S-Stop making me sound like a serial killer!

00:58.480 --> 01:00.060
You're not one?

01:00.060 --> 01:01.490
I am not!

01:03.990 --> 01:06.800
Hold it right there, missy! 
You should be ashamed of yourself!

01:06.800 --> 01:10.450
Angelic Knight or not, how could 
you bully this sweet little thing?

01:10.450 --> 01:11.630
Miss Manuela.

01:11.630 --> 01:13.630
H-Honestly, I wasn't going to...

01:13.630 --> 01:15.160
Yeah, tell her off!

01:15.160 --> 01:18.750
Nephy's a good girl and a good customer!

01:18.750 --> 01:20.390
Look at how terrible she looks!

01:20.390 --> 01:22.180
<b>She 
looks 
terrible</b>

01:20.670 --> 01:23.120
She must've been through some real hell!

01:23.120 --> 01:23.890
I didn't...

01:23.890 --> 01:25.300
Go away, Angelic Knight!

01:25.300 --> 01:26.290
You monster!

01:26.290 --> 01:28.210
Stop demanding offerings!

01:28.210 --> 01:33.310
Go away! Go away! Go away!

01:33.310 --> 01:35.110
Please, wait a minute.

01:36.910 --> 01:39.620
She hasn't actually done anything to me.

01:42.740 --> 01:45.630
But then why do you... look so terrible?

01:46.290 --> 01:49.080
I said it wasn't me!

01:49.080 --> 01:55.050
Even I get worried when 
I see a girl who looks hurt!

01:55.050 --> 01:57.050
<b>Wahhhhhhhhhhh</b>

03:27.010 --> 03:32.020
<b>Episode 5: 
Heartbreak Can Be Literally, Physically Painful</b>

03:35.420 --> 03:38.440
Pardon me for losing my composure earlier.

03:38.780 --> 03:41.410
And you really weren't bullying Nephy?

03:41.410 --> 03:43.360
I keep telling you, no!

03:43.670 --> 03:46.640
But you do seem to know her.

03:46.640 --> 03:48.760
Th-That was from a previous mission...

03:48.760 --> 03:51.420
So you'd hurt her if it was for a mission?

03:52.720 --> 03:57.690
It's actually okay. She didn't end up 
doing anything to me that time, either.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.590
Really?

04:00.590 --> 04:06.520
It was a different person who hurt my 
master, and he's already paid for that.

04:08.040 --> 04:09.380
Trees... scary...

04:09.380 --> 04:11.220
It's okay, Torres!

04:11.220 --> 04:13.020
This is just a potted plant!

04:14.800 --> 04:16.350
Got your order right here!

04:17.090 --> 04:20.570
Um... I can't accept this. 
I don't have any money.

04:20.570 --> 04:23.740
It's my treat. Don't worry, eat on up.

04:24.200 --> 04:25.950
You gotta pay for yours, though.

04:25.950 --> 04:28.370
What did I do to earn the cold shoulder?

04:32.650 --> 04:34.990
<i>This... Where have I...</i>

04:35.640 --> 04:40.730
<i>Oh, right... Last night, 
I was making this for Master.</i>

04:40.730 --> 04:42.300
<i>Lamb stew.</i>

04:46.260 --> 04:47.390
Huh?

04:47.680 --> 04:50.970
A-Are you okay?! Did I do something again?!

04:51.540 --> 04:53.520
Why... Why...

04:53.930 --> 04:56.850
Why did you do it, Master?

04:59.440 --> 05:00.780
Okay, then!

05:00.780 --> 05:04.240
Both of you can cry on the nice lady's 
shoulders until you feel better!

05:04.240 --> 05:06.360
I-I don't really need to...

05:11.580 --> 05:15.530
I see. So he kicked you out, 
and you don't know why.

05:16.570 --> 05:19.930
I thought he seemed half-decent...

05:19.930 --> 05:22.840
But now it's like he was just using you.

05:23.210 --> 05:25.690
My master isn't that kind of person.

05:25.690 --> 05:27.430
You don't have to get so angry...

05:27.430 --> 05:29.600
But I'm not angry.

05:29.600 --> 05:31.600
Your lack of expression is scary!

05:31.940 --> 05:34.980
Did anything weird happen 
before he kicked you out?

05:37.090 --> 05:38.860
I've become an Archdemon.

05:39.270 --> 05:43.230
Well... what exactly is an Archdemon?

05:44.140 --> 05:46.950
They're the most important sorcerers, right?

05:47.360 --> 05:51.300
This town used to be run by an 
Archdemon called Lord Marchosias,

05:51.300 --> 05:53.220
and things were pretty safe,

05:53.220 --> 05:56.330
but since he died, there's been 
a string of nasty business.

05:56.690 --> 05:59.450
The kidnappings of young girls by sorcerers?

05:59.450 --> 06:03.370
Yep! The Church apparently caught 
the guys behind it, though.

06:03.370 --> 06:06.380
Some sorcerer who was called the
Facestealer, I think? And his buddies.

06:08.430 --> 06:10.420
The sorcerer, Zagan.

06:10.420 --> 06:14.220
He's the one truly responsible 
for these horrid kidnappings.

06:16.090 --> 06:21.100
The townspeople didn't seem to think too 
favorably of them, in spite of that...

06:21.100 --> 06:22.830
That's because they went around demanding

06:22.830 --> 06:26.240
a ridiculous amount of money as a 
"salvation offering" right after!

06:26.240 --> 06:29.420
It's not really an offering 
if it's mandatory, is it?

06:31.720 --> 06:35.920
But... she wasn't the one who 
was asking for it, right?

06:35.920 --> 06:39.000
I don't think it's right 
to blame her for that.

06:39.250 --> 06:41.360
You're so nice!

06:41.360 --> 06:44.650
I can understand why that man 
wanted to keep you around!

06:44.650 --> 06:46.380
You... think so?

06:47.170 --> 06:49.200
Getting back on topic...

06:49.200 --> 06:52.290
The Archdemons are symbols of 
evil that the Angelic Knights

06:52.290 --> 06:54.390
are sworn to wipe out, 
even at the cost of our lives.

06:54.810 --> 06:59.310
There are only 12 Sacred 
Swords but 13 Archdemons.

06:59.310 --> 07:02.440
Even if we were to sacrifice ourselves, 
we'd still come up one short.

07:02.880 --> 07:05.250
When a new Archdemon is chosen,

07:05.250 --> 07:09.390
the Church will likely try to slay them 
before they can muster their strength.

07:09.390 --> 07:12.660
There may also be other sorcerers who 
would target them to raise their standing.

07:13.040 --> 07:15.660
<i>Then... there's likely to be fighting?</i>

07:15.970 --> 07:18.660
<i>Could that be why Master sent me away?</i>

07:19.170 --> 07:21.460
I need to ask you something.

07:22.480 --> 07:25.140
Do you think that Zagan is capable 
of organizing multiple sorcerers

07:25.140 --> 07:28.670
for the sake of kidnapping people 
to sacrifice in a ritual?

07:29.320 --> 07:30.510
I don't think so.

07:31.840 --> 07:36.600
My master is strangely uninterested 
in people he perceives as weak.

07:36.990 --> 07:39.980
When he rescued a carriage that 
was being attacked by bandits,

07:39.980 --> 07:42.980
he described it as relieving 
himself of an annoyance.

07:43.280 --> 07:48.610
<i>He may have done it to put me at 
ease, now that I think about it.</i>

07:48.910 --> 07:49.970
I thought as much.

07:50.640 --> 07:53.550
And you're probably right.

07:53.550 --> 07:59.200
When I fought him, he was holding 
back because I was a woman.

08:00.060 --> 08:02.660
As humiliating as that is... Well...

08:02.970 --> 08:06.640
Well, what?! What's that 
expression meant to convey?

08:06.640 --> 08:08.520
Am I looking at a maiden in love?

08:08.520 --> 08:13.130
Don't be absurd! It's not that, it's just...

08:13.750 --> 08:15.340
When I first met him,

08:15.790 --> 08:19.180
that man looked like he needed help.

08:20.810 --> 08:22.980
Like he needed compassion,

08:22.980 --> 08:26.340
but refused to admit it,
 and would even push it away.

08:27.180 --> 08:28.860
It's kind of hard to describe.

08:29.280 --> 08:31.080
No... I understand.

08:31.970 --> 08:34.280
Especially when he talks about his past...

08:36.300 --> 08:40.060
I can't believe there's someone 
else who noticed that.

08:41.030 --> 08:43.330
<i>I'm a little jealous, but...</i>

08:43.330 --> 08:44.570
<i>I'm also happy.</i>

08:45.810 --> 08:49.600
<i>The evening of the first day we met... 
I saw the moon from a window.</i>

08:50.300 --> 08:53.050
<i>I thought I'd never get to see it again...</i>

08:54.300 --> 08:58.140
<i>And then he looked up at it with me.</i>

08:59.180 --> 09:01.140
I don't think we can reach it.

09:01.620 --> 09:07.290
<i>Could it be that, even now, 
he still needs help?</i>

09:09.560 --> 09:12.580
I'm going back to my master.

09:13.630 --> 09:15.400
A-Are you gonna be okay?

09:16.390 --> 09:18.520
My master is very strong.

09:18.520 --> 09:21.270
I'm sure there's no one who could beat him.

09:21.270 --> 09:25.560
But... that doesn't mean he can't be hurt.

09:25.560 --> 09:28.290
No one can truly be all right on their own.

09:28.720 --> 09:29.790
I want to...

09:30.800 --> 09:33.300
I want to be there, to support my master!

09:35.550 --> 09:36.550
I see.

09:36.860 --> 09:40.680
In that case, I should 
see to my duty as well.

09:41.170 --> 09:43.510
Are you going to try and fight him again?

09:43.510 --> 09:44.680
Not that!

09:45.190 --> 09:49.880
There's a sorcerer who has
 impersonated Zagan in order to do evil.

09:49.880 --> 09:52.470
I'm may not be in a position to defend him,

09:52.470 --> 09:54.650
but I can see about clearing his name.

09:56.170 --> 10:00.120
Well, now that you two are feeling 
better, I think that's a wrap!

10:00.870 --> 10:03.060
One bill, please, for the lady knight here!

10:03.060 --> 10:03.940
Coming!

10:05.500 --> 10:07.410
I'm just joking! Relax!

10:07.990 --> 10:11.980
If you're ever in trouble again,
 come and see me.

10:11.980 --> 10:14.130
I can at least listen to you complain.

10:14.130 --> 10:17.420
And in exchange, you can try 
out a few outfits from my shop!

10:18.160 --> 10:22.100
Miss Manuela... why are 
you being so kind to me?

10:22.690 --> 10:24.850
Because we're friends, duh!

10:26.160 --> 10:27.750
Friends...?

10:27.750 --> 10:29.060
Well, aren't we?

10:29.370 --> 10:34.050
I don't know... No one has 
ever said that to me before.

10:34.050 --> 10:37.550
Then that makes me your first friend!

10:37.550 --> 10:38.480
It's an honor!

10:38.480 --> 10:40.120
R-Right...

10:40.120 --> 10:41.240
Um...

10:42.800 --> 10:47.370
Could I... also be one? A friend, I mean...

10:48.610 --> 10:52.720
Is an Angelic Knight really allowed to 
be friends with a sorcerer's associate?

10:52.720 --> 10:54.590
But...

10:56.530 --> 11:00.760
I wouldn't give you a hard time 
if we weren't friends already!

11:00.760 --> 11:03.450
Teasing is a part of friendship?

11:03.450 --> 11:05.030
Lady Chastille!

11:05.600 --> 11:06.820
Here you are!

11:06.820 --> 11:08.680
It's the one from before!

11:09.220 --> 11:12.990
The person who hurt my 
master... It's been a while.

11:12.990 --> 11:14.640
Eek, she looked at me!

11:14.640 --> 11:16.310
Calm down, Torres!

11:16.820 --> 11:18.650
Of all the timing...

11:18.650 --> 11:23.050
What's going on? Are these the 
guys who hurt Nephy's master?

11:23.050 --> 11:24.850
And you guys wonder why 
people hate the Church!

11:24.850 --> 11:28.660
I am a little curious as to 
what your issue is with us!

11:28.660 --> 11:30.490
Where the plants?! Where are they?!

11:30.990 --> 11:33.070
There are no plants in here, Torres!

11:33.070 --> 11:35.000
Just calm down!

11:35.000 --> 11:38.670
<i>Everyone getting along. Isn't that sweet?</i>

11:41.760 --> 11:43.140
Wh-Who goes there?!

11:43.950 --> 11:45.140
Run, Manuela!

11:45.710 --> 11:46.600
Chastille!

11:48.780 --> 11:51.570
<i>One got away. No matter.</i>

11:51.570 --> 11:52.730
<i>My name is Zagan!</i>

11:52.730 --> 11:54.070
Zagan!

11:54.070 --> 11:55.150
Lady Chastille!

11:55.150 --> 11:59.610
<i>If you want these women back, 
you will come to my castle.</i>

12:02.260 --> 12:04.490
<i>Why are you doing this...</i>

12:04.990 --> 12:10.000
<b>An Archdemon's Dilemma:
How to Love Your Elf Bride</b>

12:14.000 --> 12:16.380
I'd forgotten how quiet it can 
get when you're on your own.

12:19.260 --> 12:25.070
Impossible... The three Cerulean Knights 
were helpless, even fighting as one...

12:26.580 --> 12:30.720
It's your own fault for falling into one
 of my traps when you ambushed me.

12:31.180 --> 12:33.100
I didn't even need to do anything.

12:33.800 --> 12:37.730
<i>Come to think of it, 
I made this trap with Nephy...</i>

12:42.190 --> 12:43.320
<i>This is for the best.</i>

12:43.750 --> 12:47.950
<i>Nephy only spent two weeks with me.</i>

12:47.950 --> 12:51.580
<i>With a bit of distance, no one will dig 
into our relationship and put her at risk.</i>

12:52.010 --> 12:56.460
<i>The people in Kianoides are fond of her.</i>

12:56.960 --> 12:59.500
<i>She should be able to live 
a peaceful, pleasant life,</i>

12:59.500 --> 13:02.340
<i>without having to worry about 
sorcerers or the Church.</i>

13:06.240 --> 13:07.510
W-Wait...

13:08.850 --> 13:11.060
I don't care what happens to us.

13:11.060 --> 13:13.850
But... please, spare Lady Chastille!

13:15.200 --> 13:18.880
She insisted you weren't 
behind the kidnappings.

13:18.880 --> 13:22.990
She was even willing to defy the His Eminence, 
the cardinal, in order to find the true culprit!

13:22.990 --> 13:25.700
You have to at least let her go!

13:25.960 --> 13:29.410
Chastille? I'm not following you.

13:29.410 --> 13:31.540
Mister Sorcerer!

13:33.490 --> 13:35.930
How dare you, bird woman?!

13:35.930 --> 13:38.880
I already told you guys, he wasn't the one!

13:38.880 --> 13:42.580
Do you have any manners at all?! 
Who stands on another person's head like that?!

13:39.380 --> 13:41.600
<i>What is going on here?</i>

13:41.600 --> 13:43.920
<i>Whatever. Maybe I'll save myself 
the trouble and toss them all out.</i>

13:42.580 --> 13:44.630
What exactly do you mean by "bird woman"?!

13:45.160 --> 13:49.610
Mister Sorcerer, you've gotta help! 
Nephy and Chastille have been kidnapped!

13:50.520 --> 13:51.720
What?!

13:52.080 --> 13:55.480
<i>Did I take too long to 
distance myself from her?</i>

13:56.020 --> 13:59.880
Please! You can save them, can't you?!

13:59.880 --> 14:01.230
Yes, but...

14:01.560 --> 14:06.550
<i>If I openly rescue her, 
it'll make her connection to me clear.</i>

14:06.930 --> 14:09.320
<i>And if that happens,
 the Church will never leave her alone.</i>

14:10.960 --> 14:12.740
What are you standing around for?!

14:13.070 --> 14:16.050
Nephy was trying to go back to you!

14:16.050 --> 14:16.580
Wha...

14:16.580 --> 14:18.890
She wanted to stay with you!

14:18.890 --> 14:20.710
She wanted to support you!

14:21.920 --> 14:27.170
Do sorcerers not care when 
someone feels that way about them?!

14:27.170 --> 14:28.220
Because if so...

14:28.220 --> 14:31.680
Why were you nice to her in the first place?!

14:33.440 --> 14:36.890
<i>This hurts... more than any 
other attack against me before.</i>

14:37.400 --> 14:39.390
<i>Nephy was trying to come back.</i>

14:39.670 --> 14:41.900
<i>After I had said something so terrible...</i>

14:42.290 --> 14:45.320
<i>Why? No, the truth is...</i>

14:45.320 --> 14:48.190
<i>I don't even need to see those 
expressive ears of hers to know.</i>

14:48.790 --> 14:52.700
<i>She cares about me. 
About a villain like me...</i>

14:55.360 --> 14:56.560
I owe you.

14:56.980 --> 14:59.040
It's clear what I need to do.

14:59.590 --> 15:04.270
You're right. All sorcerers are 
absolute trash, without exception.

15:04.270 --> 15:06.610
They only care about themselves.

15:06.610 --> 15:09.050
They treat other people 
like tools, if anything.

15:09.460 --> 15:13.010
They consider life to be something disposable, 
that will just replenish itself without any help.

15:13.460 --> 15:14.890
What are you saying?

15:15.200 --> 15:20.230
Yes, sorcerers should only consider 
what benefits themselves most.

15:22.550 --> 15:24.800
Nephy belongs to me.

15:24.800 --> 15:29.030
And I'm going to turn whatever idiot 
dared to touch her into a crimson mist.

15:33.840 --> 15:40.010
It doesn't matter how dirty my hands are 
or how corrupt sorcerers are by nature!

15:40.010 --> 15:46.380
Even if takes all my authority and power as 
an Archdemon to do it, I will protect her!

15:51.880 --> 15:54.840
I'm going to save Nephy. Care to join me?

15:55.090 --> 15:57.600
You bet. Because I'm her friend!

15:57.940 --> 15:59.100
I see.

15:59.470 --> 16:03.050
W-Wait! Take us, too!

15:59.470 --> 16:08.730
<b>Crowd</b>

15:59.470 --> 16:08.730
<b>Crowd</b>

15:59.470 --> 16:08.730
<b>Crowd</b>

16:03.050 --> 16:04.570
Take us to Lady Chastille!

16:04.570 --> 16:08.730
Okay, fine! Just get your 
grubby mitts off me!

16:09.000 --> 16:13.060
They were snatched by some weird shadows, 
and we don't know where they've gone.

16:13.060 --> 16:14.240
Not a problem.

16:14.760 --> 16:17.080
I already know who's responsible.

16:17.690 --> 16:21.270
<i>Sorcerers really are beyond help.</i>

16:26.590 --> 16:27.780
Where am I?

16:28.880 --> 16:32.000
You're awake, Nephy. Are you hurt?

16:32.000 --> 16:33.220
Miss Chastille...

16:35.130 --> 16:38.850
<i>This collar and these manacles 
are sealing my mana away.</i>

16:39.940 --> 16:44.840
<i>Unlike the collar from before, 
these aren't particularly sophisticated, but...</i>

16:44.840 --> 16:46.370
<i>I'm not strong enough to break free.</i>

16:46.940 --> 16:47.980
<i>Maybe mysticism...</i>

16:48.840 --> 16:52.150
<i>No good. There's not enough 
nature here for me to control.</i>

17:01.180 --> 17:04.210
I thought you were my master's friend,

17:05.100 --> 17:06.290
Mister Barbatos.

17:06.720 --> 17:07.920
Friend?!

17:09.040 --> 17:10.820
Well, there's a shocker.

17:10.820 --> 17:15.050
Never thought I'd hear someone 
using that word for sorcerers.

17:15.540 --> 17:16.510
Why?

17:18.520 --> 17:21.350
Have you ever hear of a guy 
called Andras the Accursed?

17:21.840 --> 17:24.670
That's the first sorcerer Zagan ever killed.

17:24.670 --> 17:26.480
And I happen to be his student.

17:28.970 --> 17:31.550
Whoa, there. Don't get any mixed up ideas.

17:31.550 --> 17:35.450
No sensible sorcerer would care 
about avenging his teacher.

17:35.800 --> 17:38.780
If Zagan hadn't done it, 
I would've killed him myself.

17:40.280 --> 17:41.200
The thing is...

17:42.240 --> 17:44.990
That castle he's shacked up in?

17:44.990 --> 17:47.440
All the money he spent on you?

17:47.440 --> 17:52.000
Even his knowledge, all of that 
was supposed to have been mine.

17:54.050 --> 17:57.760
Can you really blame me for not wanting 
to just sit back and let him take it all?

17:58.410 --> 18:01.870
I started off by siccing the Church on him,

18:01.870 --> 18:04.100
but that didn't work out.

18:05.590 --> 18:08.700
My goons ended up leaving 
too much of a trail,

18:08.700 --> 18:11.480
and the ones I sent after Zagan 
directly got their asses kicked.

18:12.020 --> 18:15.110
Wait, then the one behind the kidnappings...

18:15.680 --> 18:18.240
Wow, you're just realizing that now?

18:18.880 --> 18:20.120
You filth...

18:21.790 --> 18:26.410
You committed those vile 
acts just to entrap Zagan?!

18:28.630 --> 18:30.130
Don't be stupid.

18:30.810 --> 18:34.630
Facestealer was the one who came 
up with the "sacrifice" business...

18:35.220 --> 18:39.130
That said, we did need the means 
to perform a major ritual.

18:41.190 --> 18:47.280
One that would demonstrate to the 12
Archdemons that I am fit to join their ranks!

18:47.280 --> 18:51.230
And ensuring another candidate is out of the 
picture is the more surefire way to pull that off!

18:52.240 --> 18:56.900
It was a shame when our sacrifices were 
snatched back, but now I've got you.

18:57.330 --> 19:01.240
A white-haired elf's mana should 
be plenty to open the door.

19:01.960 --> 19:05.740
I'm sorry, but I don't think 
there'll be any point.

19:06.260 --> 19:08.320
That's quite a claim.

19:08.320 --> 19:10.790
You think I won't kill you?

19:10.790 --> 19:13.840
Or that Zagan's gonna come and save you?

19:14.200 --> 19:17.170
<i>Master come to save me? No.</i>

19:17.680 --> 19:21.870
I wouldn't want Master to bother 
with a matter like this.

19:21.870 --> 19:25.020
That's not what I meant.

19:26.130 --> 19:26.970
Then what?

19:27.780 --> 19:31.690
My master has already ascended 
to the position of Archdemon.

19:34.220 --> 19:35.230
You're lying.

19:35.230 --> 19:38.990
It's the truth. That's why he 
released me from his service.

19:44.770 --> 19:48.700
Impossible... He's an Archdemon?!

19:49.240 --> 19:54.960
Not only did he steal Andras' fortune from me, 
now he takes the Archdemon seat?!

20:02.220 --> 20:02.990
Come on!

20:03.550 --> 20:05.580
So he's an Archdemon?

20:05.580 --> 20:09.720
Fine, then! I'll just forcibly 
take the title from him!

20:09.720 --> 20:10.980
Nephy!

20:11.550 --> 20:13.810
Once this is complete...

20:14.410 --> 20:17.270
It won't matter if he's an Archdemon!

20:19.070 --> 20:22.290
Stop! If you need a sacrifice, use me!

20:22.290 --> 20:25.110
I'm a knight. I'm prepared to give my life!

20:25.910 --> 20:30.270
No need to rush. Your turn 
will come soon enough.

20:30.270 --> 20:33.330
This ritual requires tools
 of the highest quality.

20:36.250 --> 20:37.450
<i>Tools...</i>

20:37.450 --> 20:40.730
<i>That's right. I've lived for so long 
with people calling me that...</i>

20:41.230 --> 20:41.990
<i>But...</i>

20:42.620 --> 20:45.840
<i>My master never used that 
word for me even once.</i>

20:49.320 --> 20:50.350
Let go!

20:50.870 --> 20:53.720
<i>I'm going to live and rejoin my master!</i>

20:53.720 --> 20:55.890
<i>Even if he yells at me 
or tries to chase me off,</i>

20:55.890 --> 20:57.940
<i>I'll hunker down and stay in the castle!</i>

20:58.470 --> 21:01.190
<i>I'll make food for him, 
offer my lap as a pillow...</i>

21:01.190 --> 21:04.480
<i>I'll do all the things that make him happy!</i>

21:05.210 --> 21:06.430
This woman...

21:08.600 --> 21:11.950
<i>Maybe it doesn't need to be me who does it.</i>

21:11.950 --> 21:16.000
<i>There may come a day where 
someone else is precious to him.</i>

21:16.610 --> 21:20.960
<i>But... you can't be on your own, Master!</i>

21:21.760 --> 21:24.650
This... doesn't hurt at all.

21:25.120 --> 21:28.090
Not compared to when he told me to leave.

21:28.560 --> 21:30.960
I belong to my master!

21:30.960 --> 21:33.600
I don't want you touching me!

21:34.400 --> 21:35.980
You're just a slave.

21:37.450 --> 21:39.190
Know your place!

21:48.010 --> 21:49.820
Well said, Nephy.

21:53.360 --> 21:56.460
I'd expect nothing less from my apprentice.

23:30.010 --> 23:35.010
<b>Next Time:
 If You're An Archdemon, 
You're Almost Obligated To Act Outrageously</b>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>So kind...</b>
